      "side": 1,
      "message": "This changes semantic grouping of events. Previously, soong_build (the event) was restricted to gauging the doChosenActivity call, and now it comprises the entirety of this function. This thus requires a little bit more thought than a simple cleanup CL. We definitely want an event which covers doChosenActivity alone.\n\nPerhaps remove this function\u0027s change from the CL?",
