      "writtenOn": "2022-11-07T14:38:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a little confused you seem to be implying that I have made this event encompass more than it did before when it is doing the opposite. It\u0027s not easy to see, especially when reviewing lots of separate changes. I definitely should have explained what I was doing with the events.\n\nThis function is called from within doChosenActivity so moving this event from before the call to doChosenActivity to this function doesn\u0027t expand what this event covers it narrows it.\n\nThe events that were generated before seemed to be a bit of a mess. Partly because some of the run... methods created their own EventHandler (either directly or as part of creating a new Context), something I fix later on.\n\nSo, before this change (and the immediately following one):\n\nrunSymlinkForestCreation\n* soong_build -\u003e soong_build_metrics.pb (this was the only event generated to that file and it would often be overwritten by other build actions)\n* symlink_forest -\u003e bp2build_metrics.pb\n\nrunBp2Build\n* soong_build -\u003e soong_build_metrics.pb (this was the only event generated to that file and it would often be overwritten by other build actions)\n* bp2build, ... -\u003e bp2build_metrics.pb\n\nrunApiBp2build\n* soong_build -\u003e soong_build_metrics.pb (this was the only event generated to that file and it would often be overwritten by other build actions)\n* api_bp2build -\u003e this would not be written anywhere.\n\nrunMixedModeBuild\n* soong_build, soong_build.mixed_build -\u003e soong_build_metrics.pb\n\nrunSoongBuild\n* soong_build -\u003e soong_build_metrics.pb\n\nThere was no documentation that I could find as to what events each mode was supposed to write but these seemed wrong to me. e.g. \"m nothing\" will run runSymlinkForestCreation, runBp2Build, runMixedModeBuild, writing out the \"soong_build\" event to the soong_build_metrics.pb three times but only the last one is preserved. So, clearly the soong_build event generated by the first two were not important.\n\nAfter this change (and the immediately following one):\n\nrunSymlinkForestCreation\n* symlink_forest -\u003e bp2build_metrics.pb\n\nrunBp2Build\n* bp2build, ... -\u003e bp2build_metrics.pb\n\nrunApiBp2build\n* api_bp2build -\u003e this would not be written anywhere.\n\nrunMixedModeBuild\n* soong_build, mixed_build -\u003e soong_build_metrics.pb\n\nrunSoongBuild\n* soong_build -\u003e soong_build_metrics.pb\n\nApart from the runApiBp2build build action they seem a more reasonable set. The runApiBp2build needs some more work, but I did not know what that should be.\n\nIf you still want build_soong.mixed_build then I could move that event to the block in doChosenActivity that is common to runMixedModeBuild and runSoongBuild.",
